        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Rule ID: 67022<br/>
Severity: 1<br/>
Title: Non network or service local logon.<br/>
Timestamp: 2026-07-05T08:58:55.587+0000<br/>
Pretext: WAZUH Alert</p>
